{% comment %}
Render probe for the cotton screen reader table. Unit tests render this file and
assert on the output; it is not routed anywhere. It lives apart from the tables
probe because that one holds every table to the stacked layout, and this table
is never on screen to stack.
{% endcomment %}
<c-tables.screen-reader-table caption="Probe series" data-probe="screen-reader-table">
<thead>
    <tr>
        <th scope="col">Day</th>
        <th scope="col">Count</th>
    </tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
    <tr>
        <th scope="row">Oct 7</th>
        <td>3</td>
    </tr>
</tbody>
</c-tables.screen-reader-table>
